                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><code>/src/components/ui/</code> - shadcn/ui base components (12+)</li>
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><code>/src/hooks/</code> - Custom React hooks for API operations</li>
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><code>/src/pages/</code> - Page-level components</li>
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><code>/src/types/</code> - TypeScript interfaces</li>
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><code>/src/schema/</code> - Zod validation schemas</li>
                                <li><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><code>/src/lib/</code> - Utility functions</li>
